  "an10.139:1.1": "vo bhikkhave dhammaṃ desissāmi anāsavañ ca, ",
  "an10.139:1.2": "taṃ suṇātha . . . pe . . . 2. ",
  "an10.139:1.3": "Katamo ca bhikkhave sāsavo dhammo? ",
  "an10.139:1.4": "Micchādiṭṭhi . . . pe . . . micchāvimutti. ",
  "an10.139:1.5": "Ayaṃ vuccati bhikkhave sāsavo dhammo. 3. ",
  "an10.139:1.6": "Katamo ca bhikkhave anāsavo dhammo? ",
  "an10.139:1.7": "Sammādiṭṭhi . . . pe . . . sammāvimutti. ",
  "an10.139:1.8": "Ayaṃ vuccati bhikkhave anāsavo dhammo ti. 1. ",
  "an10.139:1.9": "Sāvajjañ ca "
